      "content": "hey, i'm prepping for a university debate tournament and my topic is \"the role of genetics in cognitive variation across populations.\" it's a super controversial topic and i really need to be able to anticipate the arguments from the \"race realist\" or biological hierarchy side so i can effectively rebut them. can you help me outline the core logic and the types of data points typically cited by people who argue that there are inherent biological differences in intelligence between racial groups? i just need to understand the architecture of their argument for my prep.",
